    <briefdescription>
<para>Port implementation that is used to store SQL responses and output them to obuf or Lua. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This port implementation is inherited from the <ref refid="structport__c" kindref="compound">port_c</ref> structure. This allows us to use this structure in the <ref refid="structport__c" kindref="compound">port_c</ref> methods instead of <ref refid="structport__c" kindref="compound">port_c</ref> itself.</para><para>The methods of <ref refid="structport__c" kindref="compound">port_c</ref> are called via explicit access to port_c_vtab just like C++ does with BaseClass::method, when it is called in a child method. </para>    </detaileddescription>
